    "description": "TDC SOFT Inc. provides IT consulting services in Japan. The company provides Agile, UX design, scrum training, scaled Agile framework, security, artificial intelligence consulting, and system integration infrastructure services and solutions. It also offers SAFe, a product owner / product manager; UNIX server migration service; ASTERIA Warp, a domestic data integration tool that connects various systems in a non-coding manner; amazon web services; M-check+, a cloud application for stress check; Boomi, a low-code development platform that allows for easy data linkage and integration of all types of data; and BP-LINKS, an EdI service that makes ordering, and monthly billing and settlement paperless. In addition, the company provides HuTaCT, a human resource talent management system; Informatica, a data management platform; Trustpro, a cloud-based development framework; GitLab, a DevOps platform that allows you to manage version control, code review, and CI/CD in a single application; OpenCanvas; oracle ERP related services; PC procurement kitting service; progress corticon, Qlik sense; salesforce related services; SAP related services; total security services, Tegata; and WinActor, a software-type robot, as well as support services for Microsoft 365. Further, it offers Meeepa, an EDI service that digitizes business transactions related to outsourcing; Nenoa, a private AI appliance that includes AI chat and an AI editor that handles everything from document creation to programming; Darktrace, an enterprise security product; Styleflow, a cloud-based business process optimization system; Question Craft; Movina; and ServiceNow. TDC SOFT Inc. was founded in 1962 and is headquartered in Chiyoda, Japan."
